   "widgets_values": [
    "\"integrated_multimodal_description\": \"[Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a low-angle medium-wide tracking shot follows two athletic martial artists sparring on a rain-slick rooftop at blue hour, city lights glowing behind them. The camera arcs right at fast speed as the fighter in a red jacket ducks beneath a spinning kick, plants one hand on the wet concrete, sweeps the other fighter's legs, and both recover into guarded stances without injury. Water sprays from each footfall and a loose rooftop cable whips in the wind.\",\n      \"overall_soundscape\": \"Strong rooftop wind, rapid shoe scrapes, fabric snaps, controlled grunts, and three crisp padded impacts echo between nearby buildings. Distant traffic and a low thunder roll remain underneath.\",\n      \"non_diegetic_music\": \"Fast taiko drums and short low-string ostinatos accelerate, then stop sharply on the final stance.\""
